        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 3:45PM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TONIGHT...E wind 40 kt. Seas 12 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI...E wind 45 kt becoming SE 30 kt in the afternoon. Seas 13
ft. Rain showers.
.FRI NIGHT...SE wind 25 kt. Seas 7 ft. Rain showers.
.SAT...SE wind 25 kt. Seas 5 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...SE wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.SUN...NE wind 15 kt. Seas 3 ft.
.MON THROUGH TUE...W wind 25 kt. Seas 6 ft.
</description>
